# Northern Air Temple: "Whenever another Shrine you control enters, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life." Bot1's second
# Temple (legendary: the legend rule keeps one of the two, CR 704.5j) makes two triggers: the first Temple's, for another Shrine
# entering (1), and the second Temple's own "enters" (X is 1 by the time it resolves, as only one Temple is left). Bot2 loses
# 1 + 1 = 2 more (19, 17) and Bot1 gains 2 (21, 23); the first Temple's trigger resolves although it was the one put into the graveyard.

